>>SOURCE FORMAT FREE
IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. CALENDAR-WORK-COUNTS.
DATA DIVISION.
LOCAL-STORAGE SECTION.
01 WS-OP PIC X(16).
01 WS-TEXT PIC X(8192).
01 WS-LEN PIC 9(18) COMP-5 VALUE 0.
01 WS-CMP PIC S9(4) COMP-5 VALUE 0.
01 WS-STATUS PIC 9(4) COMP-5 VALUE 0.
01 WS-CLEAN PIC 9(4) COMP-5 VALUE 0.
01 WS-A.
   05 WA-SIGN PIC S9(4) COMP-5 VALUE 0.
   05 WA-CHUNKS PIC 9(18) COMP-5 VALUE 0.
   05 WA-HEAD USAGE POINTER.
   05 WA-TAIL USAGE POINTER.
01 WS-B.
   05 WB-SIGN PIC S9(4) COMP-5 VALUE 0.
   05 WB-CHUNKS PIC 9(18) COMP-5 VALUE 0.
   05 WB-HEAD USAGE POINTER.
   05 WB-TAIL USAGE POINTER.
01 WS-OUT.
   05 WO-SIGN PIC S9(4) COMP-5 VALUE 0.
   05 WO-CHUNKS PIC 9(18) COMP-5 VALUE 0.
   05 WO-HEAD USAGE POINTER.
   05 WO-TAIL USAGE POINTER.
01 WS-REM.
   05 WR-SIGN PIC S9(4) COMP-5 VALUE 0.
   05 WR-CHUNKS PIC 9(18) COMP-5 VALUE 0.
   05 WR-HEAD USAGE POINTER.
   05 WR-TAIL USAGE POINTER.
LINKAGE SECTION.
01 LK-C-DAY.
   05 LC-SIGN PIC S9(4) COMP-5.
   05 LC-CHUNKS PIC 9(18) COMP-5.
   05 LC-HEAD USAGE POINTER.
   05 LC-TAIL USAGE POINTER.
01 LK-T-DAY.
   05 LT-SIGN PIC S9(4) COMP-5.
   05 LT-CHUNKS PIC 9(18) COMP-5.
   05 LT-HEAD USAGE POINTER.
   05 LT-TAIL USAGE POINTER.
01 LK-C-COUNT.
   05 CC-SIGN PIC S9(4) COMP-5.
   05 CC-CHUNKS PIC 9(18) COMP-5.
   05 CC-HEAD USAGE POINTER.
   05 CC-TAIL USAGE POINTER.
01 LK-T-COUNT.
   05 TC-SIGN PIC S9(4) COMP-5.
   05 TC-CHUNKS PIC 9(18) COMP-5.
   05 TC-HEAD USAGE POINTER.
   05 TC-TAIL USAGE POINTER.
01 LK-DISTANCE.
   05 DI-SIGN PIC S9(4) COMP-5.
   05 DI-CHUNKS PIC 9(18) COMP-5.
   05 DI-HEAD USAGE POINTER.
   05 DI-TAIL USAGE POINTER.
01 LK-CONNECTION.
   05 CN-SIGN PIC S9(4) COMP-5.
   05 CN-CHUNKS PIC 9(18) COMP-5.
   05 CN-HEAD USAGE POINTER.
   05 CN-TAIL USAGE POINTER.
01 LK-DIRECTION PIC 9 COMP-5.
01 LK-STATUS PIC 9(4) COMP-5.
PROCEDURE DIVISION USING LK-C-DAY LK-T-DAY
    LK-C-COUNT LK-T-COUNT LK-DISTANCE LK-CONNECTION
    LK-DIRECTION LK-STATUS.
MAIN.
    *> 调用者提供有效整数和独立、空的输出槽。
    MOVE 0 TO LK-STATUS
    SET WA-HEAD WA-TAIL WB-HEAD WB-TAIL
        WO-HEAD WO-TAIL WR-HEAD WR-TAIL TO NULL
    IF CC-SIGN NOT = 0 OR CC-CHUNKS NOT = 0
       OR CC-HEAD NOT = NULL OR CC-TAIL NOT = NULL
        MOVE 175 TO LK-STATUS
        GOBACK
    END-IF
    IF TC-SIGN NOT = 0 OR TC-CHUNKS NOT = 0
       OR TC-HEAD NOT = NULL OR TC-TAIL NOT = NULL
        MOVE 175 TO LK-STATUS
        GOBACK
    END-IF
    IF DI-SIGN NOT = 0 OR DI-CHUNKS NOT = 0
       OR DI-HEAD NOT = NULL OR DI-TAIL NOT = NULL
        MOVE 175 TO LK-STATUS
        GOBACK
    END-IF
    IF CN-SIGN NOT = 0 OR CN-CHUNKS NOT = 0
       OR CN-HEAD NOT = NULL OR CN-TAIL NOT = NULL
        MOVE 175 TO LK-STATUS
        GOBACK
    END-IF
    MOVE 0 TO LK-DIRECTION
    IF LC-SIGN < -1 OR LC-SIGN > 1
       OR LT-SIGN < -1 OR LT-SIGN > 1
        MOVE 22 TO LK-STATUS
        GOBACK
    END-IF
    CALL "PATCHED-DAY-TAG" USING
        LK-C-DAY LK-C-COUNT WS-STATUS
    IF WS-STATUS = 0
        CALL "PATCHED-DAY-TAG" USING
            LK-T-DAY LK-T-COUNT WS-STATUS
    END-IF
    IF WS-STATUS = 0
        CALL "PATCHED-DISTANCE" USING
            LK-C-DAY LK-T-DAY LK-DISTANCE WS-STATUS
    END-IF
    IF WS-STATUS = 0
        MOVE "ADD" TO WS-OP
        CALL "BIG-INTEGER-SERVICE" USING
            WS-OP WS-TEXT WS-LEN LK-C-COUNT LK-T-COUNT
            LK-CONNECTION WS-REM WS-CMP WS-STATUS
    END-IF
    IF WS-STATUS = 0
        MOVE "CMP" TO WS-OP
        CALL "BIG-INTEGER-SERVICE" USING
            WS-OP WS-TEXT WS-LEN LK-T-DAY LK-C-DAY
            WS-OUT WS-REM WS-CMP WS-STATUS
    END-IF
    IF WS-STATUS NOT = 0
        MOVE WS-STATUS TO LK-STATUS
        PERFORM RELEASE-RESULTS
        GOBACK
    END-IF
    EVALUATE TRUE
        WHEN WS-CMP < 0 MOVE 1 TO LK-DIRECTION
        WHEN WS-CMP = 0 MOVE 2 TO LK-DIRECTION
        WHEN WS-CMP > 0 MOVE 3 TO LK-DIRECTION
    END-EVALUATE
    GOBACK.
RELEASE-RESULTS.
    *> 保留原始失败状态；清理失败不被解释为成功。
    MOVE "FREE-A" TO WS-OP
    CALL "BIG-INTEGER-SERVICE" USING
        WS-OP WS-TEXT WS-LEN LK-C-COUNT WS-B
        WS-OUT WS-REM WS-CMP WS-CLEAN
    MOVE "FREE-A" TO WS-OP
    CALL "BIG-INTEGER-SERVICE" USING
        WS-OP WS-TEXT WS-LEN LK-T-COUNT WS-B
        WS-OUT WS-REM WS-CMP WS-CLEAN
    MOVE "FREE-A" TO WS-OP
    CALL "BIG-INTEGER-SERVICE" USING
        WS-OP WS-TEXT WS-LEN LK-DISTANCE WS-B
        WS-OUT WS-REM WS-CMP WS-CLEAN
    MOVE "FREE-A" TO WS-OP
    CALL "BIG-INTEGER-SERVICE" USING
        WS-OP WS-TEXT WS-LEN LK-CONNECTION WS-B
        WS-OUT WS-REM WS-CMP WS-CLEAN.
END PROGRAM CALENDAR-WORK-COUNTS.
